msgid "Required to be able to reset password if you forget it"
msgstr "Vereist om je wachtwoord te kunnen resetten als je het vergeet"

msgid "Sign up"
msgstr "Registreren"

msgid ""
"Create your private space, then link your Tesla account in a few steps."
msgstr ""
"Maak je privéruimte aan en koppel daarna je Tesla-account in een paar "
"stappen."

msgid "Already registered?"
msgstr "Al geregistreerd?"

msgid "Login"
msgstr "Inloggen"

#, python-format
msgid "Partner public key must be served over HTTPS (got %(scheme)s)."
msgstr ""
"De openbare partnersleutel moet via HTTPS worden aangeboden (ontvangen: "
"%(scheme)s)."

msgid "Could not read a host from that URL."
msgstr "Kon geen host uit die URL lezen."

#, python-format
msgid ""
"Tesla always fetches the public key at https://%(host)s%(path)s — not at an "
"arbitrary path. Host the PEM there (any HTTPS server is fine: nginx, S3, "
"Cloudflare, GitHub Pages, …)."
msgstr ""
"Tesla haalt de openbare sleutel altijd op via https://%(host)s%(path)s — "
"niet via een willekeurig pad. Host de PEM daar (elke HTTPS-server is prima: "
"nginx, S3, Cloudflare, GitHub Pages, …)."

msgid ""
"Tesla rejects localhost as a partner domain. Use a public HTTPS domain."
msgstr ""
"Tesla weigert localhost als partnerdomein. Gebruik een openbaar HTTPS-"
"domein."

#, python-format
msgid "Cannot reach %(url)s: %(err)s"
msgstr "Kan %(url)s niet bereiken: %(err)s"

#, python-format
msgid "%(url)s → HTTP %(code)s"
msgstr "%(url)s → HTTP %(code)s"

#, python-format
msgid "%(url)s does not contain a valid public key PEM"
msgstr "%(url)s bevat geen geldige openbare sleutel (PEM)"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"%(url)s is reachable but does not match the local key (%(path)s). Re-upload "
"the file."
msgstr ""
"%(url)s is bereikbaar maar komt niet overeen met de lokale sleutel "
"(%(path)s). Upload het bestand opnieuw."

#, python-format
msgid "Public key OK: %(url)s"
msgstr "Openbare sleutel OK: %(url)s"

msgid "Missing Client ID / Secret."
msgstr "Client ID / Secret ontbreken."

#, python-format
msgid "Partner token failed (%(code)s): %(body)s"
msgstr "Partnertoken mislukt (%(code)s): %(body)s"

msgid "Missing app settings."
msgstr "App-instellingen ontbreken."

msgid ""
"Tesla rejects localhost as a partner domain. Use a public HTTPS domain (e.g."
" robotcar.example.com)."
msgstr ""
"Tesla weigert localhost als partnerdomein. Gebruik een openbaar HTTPS-domein"
" (bijv. robotcar.example.com)."

#, python-format
msgid "Public key not reachable by Tesla before register: %(msg)s"
msgstr "Openbare sleutel niet bereikbaar voor Tesla vóór register: %(msg)s"

#, python-format
msgid "Partner register failed (%(code)s): %(body)s"
msgstr "Partnerregister mislukt (%(code)s): %(body)s"

msgid "Client ID"
msgstr "Client ID"

msgid "Client secret"
msgstr "Client secret"

msgid "OAuth redirect URI"
msgstr "OAuth-omleidings-URI"

msgid "Fleet API region"
msgstr "Fleet API-regio"

msgid ""
"Must match the redirect URI on developer.tesla.com exactly (often "
"http://localhost:8001/oauth/callback for a local install)."
msgstr ""
"Moet exact overeenkomen met de omleidings-URI op developer.tesla.com (vaak "
"http://localhost:8001/oauth/callback bij lokale installatie)."

msgid "Europe / Middle East / Africa (recommended for Belgium)"
msgstr "Europa / Midden-Oosten / Afrika (aanbevolen voor België)"

msgid "North America / Asia-Pacific (excl. China)"
msgstr "Noord-Amerika / Azië-Pacific (excl. China)"

msgid "China"
msgstr "China"

msgid "Partner domain or public key URL"
msgstr "Partnerdomein of URL van openbare sleutel"

msgid ""
"Paste a domain (example.com), an origin (https://example.com), or the full "
"public-key URL. Hosting is free choice (nginx, S3, Cloudflare, GitHub Pages,"
" …) but Tesla always fetches /.well-known/appspecific/com.tesla.3p.public-"
"key.pem on that host. Add the same host with https:// as Allowed Origin on "
"developer.tesla.com. Not localhost."
msgstr ""
"Plak een domein (example.com), een origin (https://example.com) of de "
"volledige URL van de openbare sleutel. Hosting is vrij te kiezen (nginx, S3,"
" Cloudflare, GitHub Pages, …) maar Tesla haalt altijd /.well-"
"known/appspecific/com.tesla.3p.public-key.pem op die host op. Voeg dezelfde "
"host met https:// toe als Allowed Origin op developer.tesla.com. Geen "
"localhost."

