msgid ""
"Tip: switch Envelope to Min / max to get day-map links for the samples that "
"form the band edges."
msgstr "Tip: zet Envelop op Min / max voor dagkaartlinks op de bandranden."

msgid ""
"\n"
"    Only Supercharging / CCS-style sessions (peak ≥ ~40 kW, or flagged fast charger) are used —\n"
"    home AC and destination charging are excluded. The rising power edge after plug-in is\n"
"    dropped by cutting samples before the first peak of each session (whether that peak is at\n"
"    10 s or 2 min) so the curve and min/max measure the real profile, not a fixed time window.\n"
"    Robust filter further drops sessions with unusually low peak power (typical of V2 stall\n"
"    sharing) and cold / unpreconditioned crawls. V3 vs V4 stalls are not separated: the car caps\n"
"    at its max power either way.\n"
"    "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"    Alleen Supercharge-/CCS-sessies (piek ≥ ~40 kW of gemarkeerde snellader) — thuis-AC en\n"
"    destination vallen af. De eerste ~2 minuten van elke sessie (en vroege monsters nog ver\n"
"    onder de sessiepiek) worden weggelaten zodat de Supercharger-opbouw de curve niet omlaag\n"
"    trekt. Het robuuste filter verwijdert ook lage pieken (V2-deling) en koude starts. V3/V4\n"
"    worden niet gescheiden.\n"
"    "

